    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fe66e11b7bd50295c2a38d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fe66e11b7bd50295c2a38d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 22:43:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🇺🇸🇬🇧💙</span></p><p><span>Hello everyone. Nice to meet you. Today is Saturday. I live in Fujian Province, China. My name is Melody. You can also call me Halo. How is everything going today?</span></p><p><span>The weather is cool in my city, so I feel very comfortable. I played card games yesterday. I also practiced my Korean and shared some videos with everyone.</span></p><p><span>🇰🇷🤎</span></p><p><span>안녕하세요. 하루라고 합니다.</span></p><p><span>오늘은 토요일이에요.</span></p><p><span>저는 중국에 사는 중국인이에요.</span></p><p><span>날씨가 흐리고 선선해요.</span></p><p><span>&lt;유미의 세포들&gt; 드라마를 봤어요.</span></p><p><span>드라마 정말 재미있어요.</span></p><p><span>여기까지입니다.</span></p><p><span>다음에 봐요.</span></p><p><span>🇯🇵💫</span></p><p><span>こんにちは。春と申します。</span></p><p><span>今日は土曜日です。</span></p><p><span>今、私が住んでいる場所は曇っています。</span></p><p><span>昨日は韓国ドラマを見ながら韓国語を勉強しました。</span></p><p><span>はい、ここまでです。</span></p><p><span>最後まで聞いてくださり、ありがとうございます。</span></p><p><span>またね。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62d6608d4e2854a25954c426/FskY8bpHXzcOlXF1HGTxldk39Hre.m4a" length="1696739" type="audio/mp4"/>
